      "questName": "Shade's Hidden Forum Review",
      "questDescription": "Shade directs {player} to review an authorized in-world hidden forum from an isolated investigation client. Unlock the client, open the supplied address, choose a non-interactive collection approach, and locate the pinned archive while remembering that isolation reduces risk but does not guarantee anonymity.",
